---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const pageTitle = "About";
const pageDescription = "About DissidentX";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
	<div class="grid place-items-center min-h-[80vh]">
		<div class="mx-auto px-4 prose text-white/60 text-center">
			<h1 class="font-display">What is this all about?</h1>
			<p class="text-justify">
				DissidentX exists as a space for honest inquiry and reflection -
				a platform for those who value truth beyond convenience or
				conformity. In an age marked by conformity, this project is an
				invitation to think critically, question prevailing narratives,
				and engage deeply with the ideas that have shaped history,
				philosophy, and culture.
			</p>
			<p class="text-justify">
				It is born from a personal commitment to serious self-study in
				philosophy, theology, and classical literature, and a belief
				that the challenges of our time demand vigilance—not only in
				defense of liberty but in the cultivation of character and
				wisdom. Here, I document an ongoing journey of learning and
				growth, and I welcome others—young men and all seekers alike—who
				are willing to join in this pursuit of meaning and truth.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
